        "created_at": "2012-11-27T18:20:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Blossercubbles\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/48/1863_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blossercubbles:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's been a while since I read his update, but I believe that Proletariat was fully aware that he was going to be frozen and thawed out in the future when his country needed him most.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It doesn't make it clear either way.</p>",
