        "created_at": "2012-11-28T21:32:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"evandan55\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/48/2374_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> evandan55:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So if Tachyon is (figuratively) Neil Patrick Harris, does this mean Friction is (figuratively) Nathan Fillion?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>… Wow…</p>\n<p>Never thought of that. But Nathan is a good guy… well a hero… he almost never plays bad…</p>\n<p>I just realized that Nathan FIllion never really plays Lawful Good ecept in SLITHER. Either he's an adulterer, a rebel anti government nut, a dickish superhero nut. …</p>\n<p>Oh wait. I forgot about Green Lantern. Nevermind.</p>",
