        "id": 46785,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-29T05:07:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I can imagine it now…AZ:&nbsp; \"What is your PROBLEM, Starface!?\"P:\"Что?\"AZ:\"I get a million different versions of a guy who hates me and I can't even banter with him…Being a superhero sucks.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I kind of pictured the scene as everyone pairs off and then when those two start fighting, Proletariat is really passionate and engaged and Zero is very disinterested which just makes Proletariat more angry. \"Being a superhero sucks.\" is a perfect AZ line, though.</p>",
